# =============================================================================
# Abyss — .gitignore
# Stack: Go + Wails v2 backend, Vite + React + TS + Mantine frontend, SQLite
# Targets: macOS + Windows
#
# Critical: this is a password & key vault. Never commit vault files, key
# material, decrypted exports, or environment secrets.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensitive material — DO NOT COMMIT (vault data, keys, secrets)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SQLite vault files and any side-car journal/WAL files
*.vault
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Cryptographic key material that may end up in repo via copy/paste, exports,
# or ad-hoc test fixtures. Keep it out of git regardless of intent.
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.csr
*.gpg
*.asc
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
id_dsa
known_hosts

# Environment files (any secrets, paths, signing creds)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Local exports / scratch (developer-only ad-hoc dumps)
/exports/
/tmp/
/scratch/
*.bak
*.swp
*.tmp

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Wails v2 build artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled application binaries
/build/bin/
/build/darwin/Build/
/build/darwin/DerivedData/
/build/windows/installer/
/build/windows/info.json
/build/appicon.png.bak

# Wails v2 generated TS bindings (regenerated by `wails build` / `wails dev`)
/frontend/wailsjs/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Go
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled binaries (wildcards catch ad-hoc `go build` outputs in repo root)
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
abyss
abyss.exe

# Test binaries and coverage
*.test
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt
*.coverprofile
/coverage/

# Profiling
*.prof
*.pprof

# Go workspace (per-developer; not part of repo state)
go.work
go.work.sum

# Vendored deps (only if `go mod vendor` is used; safe to ignore by default)
/vendor/

# Go module cache (when using a workspace-local cache)
/.gocache/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend — Node / Vite / React / TypeScript / Mantine
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
/frontend/node_modules/
/node_modules/

# Build output
/frontend/dist/
/frontend/build/
/frontend/.vite/
/frontend/stats.html

# Logs
/frontend/npm-debug.log*
/frontend/yarn-debug.log*
/frontend/yarn-error.log*
/frontend/pnpm-debug.log*
*-debug.log
*-error.log
lerna-debug.log*

# Package manager state
/frontend/.npm/
/frontend/.yarn/cache
/frontend/.yarn/unplugged
/frontend/.yarn/build-state.yml
/frontend/.yarn/install-state.gz
/frontend/.pnp.*
/frontend/.pnpm-store/

# Test output (Vitest / Playwright)
/frontend/coverage/
/frontend/test-results/
/frontend/playwright-report/
/frontend/playwright/.cache/

# TypeScript incremental build state
*.tsbuildinfo
.tsbuildinfo
/frontend/.tsbuildinfo
/frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Vite / esbuild caches
.vite/
.esbuild/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS — macOS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.TemporaryItems
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk
Icon

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS — Windows
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump
*.lnk

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS — Linux (in case of hybrid dev environments; we don't ship Linux but devs may use it)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / IDEs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JetBrains (GoLand, WebStorm, IntelliJ)
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# VS Code — keep workspace recommendations / launch shareable, ignore per-user
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets
.history/

# Vim / Neovim
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
Session.vim
.netrwhist
tags
.vim/

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# Zed
.zed/
